  <div class="side-text"><div class="text">
<p><strong>NeoPixel Digital RGB LED Weatherproof Strip </strong>is available in three different “densities”: 30, 60 and 144 LEDs per meter, on a white or black backing strip.</p>
<ul>
<li><a title="Link: http://www.adafruit.com/products/1376" href="../www.adafruit.com/products/1376"><strong>30 LEDs per meter, white strip</strong></a></li>
<li><a title="Link: http://www.adafruit.com/products/1460" href="../www.adafruit.com/products/1460"><strong>30 LEDs per meter, black strip</strong></a></li>
<li><a href="../www.adafruit.com/products/1138"><strong>60 LEDs per meter, white strip</strong></a></li>
<li><a href="../www.adafruit.com/products/1461"><strong>60 LEDs per meter, black strip</strong></a></li>
<li><a href="../www.adafruit.com/products/1507"><strong>144 LEDs per meter, white strip</strong></a></li>
<li><strong><a title="Link: http://www.adafruit.com/products/1506" href="../www.adafruit.com/products/1506">144 LEDs per meter, black strip</a></strong></li>
</ul>
<p>The <em>approximate</em> peak power use (all LEDs on at maximum brightness) per meter is:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong>30</strong> LEDs: 9 Watts (about 1.8 Amps at 5 Volts).</li>
<li>
<strong>60</strong> LEDs: 18 Watts (about 3.6 Amps at 5 Volts).</li>
<li>
<strong>144</strong> LEDs : 43 watts (8.6 Amps at 5 Volts).</li>
</ul>
<p>Mixed colors and lower brightness settings will use proportionally less power.</p>
</div></div>
