  <div class="side-text"><div class="text"><p>For those using <a href="../www.adafruit.com/product/3333">Circuit Playground Express</a> or just needing a “<strong>no soldering</strong>” option (as in most classrooms), we have a special <a href="../www.adafruit.com/product/3811"><strong>half-meter, 30-LED NeoPixel strip with alligator clips attached</strong></a>. Easy!</p></div></div>
