  <div class="side-text"><div class="text"><p>This distinctive NeoPixel flex strip has a gorgeous diffused <em>neon-like</em> appearance thanks to its thick silicone casing.</p>
<p>This strip contains <strong>60 LED along the meter but in groups of 3-LEDs-per-pixel.</strong> So basically, in your NeoPixel program, <strong>this looks like a 20-pixel-long strand.</strong></p>
<p>Unlike the other varieties of NeoPixel strip, this one needs to be powered from 9 Volts (minimum) to 12 Volts (ideal) DC.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="../www.adafruit.com/product/3869"><strong>NeoPixel RGB Neon-like LED Flex Strip with Silicone Tube - 1 meter</strong></a></li>
