  <div class="side-text"><div class="text">
            <p>Like NeoPixel strips, these “<strong>strands</strong>” are <strong>flexible</strong> and can be wrapped around things. The pixels are spaced further apart (2 or 4 inches) and each pixel is either sealed in its own tiny plastic capsule or epoxy-dipped, making them <strong>weatherproof</strong> (but not rated for continuous submersion). There are <strong>20 pixels</strong> in a strand (except for the “Soft Flexible” variety, with 50).</p>
