<li><a href="../www.adafruit.com/product/3630"><strong>NeoPixel Strand — 20 LEDs at 2" Pitch</strong></a></li>
<li><a href="../www.adafruit.com/product/5225"><strong>Slim NeoPixel Strand — 20 LEDs at 2" Pitch</strong></a></li>
<li><a href="../www.adafruit.com/product/4560"><strong>Soft Flexible NeoPixel Strand — 50 LEDs at 4" Pitch</strong></a></li>
</ul>
          </div></div>
