  <div class="side-text"><div class="text"><p><strong>Flexible NeoPixel matrices</strong> are available in three different sizes:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong><a href="../www.adafruit.com/products/2612">8x8 RGB pixels</a></strong></li>
<li><strong><a href="../www.adafruit.com/products/2547">16x16 RGB pixels</a></strong></li>
<li><strong><a href="../www.adafruit.com/products/2294">8x32 RGB pixels</a></strong></li>
