      <div class="text-element">
  
      
      
      <p>Though not all “Shields” in the strictly-speaking Arduino sense, a few NeoPixel products are designed to fit directly atop (or below) certain microcontroller boards…</p>
    
    
    
</div>

      <div class="text-element">
  
      
      
      <h1><div class="anchor-anchor"><a href="./adafruit-neopixel-uberguide__21015941" class="anchor-link"><span class="fa fa-link"></span></a><span id="neopixel-shield-for-arduino-2894434" class="anchor-link-target"></span></div>NeoPixel Shield for Arduino</h1>
    
    
    
</div>

      <div class="side-element">
    <div class="side-images">
