    </div>
  <div class="side-text"><div class="text"><p>The <strong><a href="../www.adafruit.com/products/2288">Pimoroni Unicorn Hat</a></strong> is aptly named after a mythical animal — normally we’ll say that NeoPixels don’t work with the Raspberry Pi, but Pimoroni has worked up some <a href="../github.com/pimoroni/unicorn-hat">magical software</a> that makes this combination possible! It’s an 8x8 RGB matrix that fits neatly atop the Raspberry Pi Model A+, B+ or Pi 2.</p>
<p>Due to the way Unicorn HAT works, you can't use your Pi's analog audio alongside it. If you see odd random colour patterns and flickering make sure analog audio is disabled.</p></div></div>
</div>

