        <p>Pebble Pixels, also know as Seed Pixels, are a fantastic innovation in smart pixel technology. They're affordable and really robust. With silicone coated wire and resin coated pixels, you'll find that it's very hard to break these things, which makes them perfect for cosplay projects.&nbsp;</p>
<p>They can be a little tricky to solder to, so take a deep breath and give yourself plenty of time.&nbsp;</p>
      














