            <h2>
              <span id="individual-neopixels">Individual NeoPixels</span>
            </h2>

            <section class="page-content">
                <div class="" role="region" aria-label="Page content">
      <div class="text-element">
  
  
  
  
  
  
      
      <p>If you need just a small number of pixels…or if ready-made shapes and strips don’t quite provide what you’re after…<strong>individual NeoPixels</strong> provide the most control over placement and quantity.</p>
    
    





</div>

      <div class="text-element">
  
  
  
  
  
  
      
      <h1><div class="anchor-anchor"><a href="./adafruit-neopixel-uberguide__21015941" class="anchor-link"><span class="fa fa-link"></span></a><span id="integrated-neopixel-products-2894449" class="anchor-link-target"></span></div>Integrated NeoPixel Products</h1>
<p>Some individual NeoPixel products come <strong>ready to use</strong>, with a small PCB holding the LED, a decoupling capacitor for power, and points for connecting wires.</p>
    
    





</div>

      <div class="text-element">
  
  
  
  
  
  
      
      
