  <div class="side-text"><div class="text"><p>These are similar to the sewable Flora NeoPixels, but with a pin arrangement that (with the addition of headers) fits neatly into a breadboard for prototyping. Also available in two formats:</p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong><a href="../www.adafruit.com/products/1312">Pack of 4</a></strong>, ready to use as-is.</li>
