<strong><a href="../www.adafruit.com/products/1558">Sheet of 25</a></strong>, cut off as needed.</li>
</ul>
<p>For both types, <strong><a href="../www.adafruit.com/products/392">headers</a> are optional and not included</strong>.</p>
<p>Breadboard-Friendly NeoPixels measure 10.2 x 12.7 millimeters (0.4 x 0.5 inches) and are <strong>RGB</strong> only; there’s no RGBW version.</p></div></div>
