  <div class="side-text"><div class="text"><p>Tiny surface-mount “<strong>3535</strong>” (3.5 millimeters square) NeoPixels are available in two <strong>RGB</strong> versions; no RGBW is available.</p>
<ul>
<li>
<strong><a href="../www.adafruit.com/products/2659">NeoPixel Mini 3535 RGB – white case</a></strong> – pack of 10.</li>
<li>
<strong><a href="../www.adafruit.com/products/2686">NeoPixel Mini 3535 RGB – black case</a></strong> – pack of 10.</li>
</ul>
<p>Decoupling capacitor recommended, as described above. As with the “5050” NeoPixels, white- and black-cased versions are functionally identical, this is an aesthetic design option.</p></div></div>
</div>

