      <div class="text-element">
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
        <p><span>What is better than smart&nbsp;LEDs? Smart&nbsp;</span><strong>WWA</strong><span>&nbsp;LEDs! WWA LEDs have 3 white LEDs in them in three tints (also known as 'color temperatures'): warm white, cool white and amber, great for excellent lighting effects that want pure white lite. These are fun and glowy, and you can control each LED individually, just like you do with traditional RGB LED NeoPixels.</span></p>
      













</div>

      <div class="side-element">
    <div class="side-images">
