  <div class="side-text"><div class="text">
            <p>For many wearable projects we recommend a <a href="../www.adafruit.com/products/328">lithium-polymer battery</a>. These deliver 3.7 Volts — perfect for directly feeding low-power microcontrollers such as the Adafruit Flora, yet sufficient for a short length of NeoPixels.</p>
