  <div class="side-text"><div class="text">Three alkaline cells (such as AA batteries) can be installed in a <a href="../www.adafruit.com/products/771">battery holder</a> to provide 4.5 Volts. Though larger and heaver than the fancy lithium-polymer pack, they’re inexpensive and readily available.</div></div>
