  <div class="side-text"><div class="text">Four nickel-metal hydride (NiMH) rechargeable cells can similarly be used in a <a href="../www.adafruit.com/products/830">4-cell battery holder</a> to provide 4.8 Volts.<br><br><b>Make sure you </b><u><b>only</b></u><b> use NiMH cells in this configuration.</b> Four alkaline cells (the disposable type) will output 6V total — that’s too high for some NeoPixels, and definitely too much for the microcontroller!</div></div>
