  <div class="side-text"><div class="text">
            <p>A <a href="../www.adafruit.com/product/1385"><em>buck converter</em></a> can efficiently step a higher DC voltage down to 5V for NeoPixels and microcontrollers … for example if you have a 12V power source, like a car battery.</p>
<p>Different converters have <span>a specific input voltage range and output maximum current, so check specifications carefully.</span></p>
