      <p><strong>It’s assumed at this point that you have the Adafruit_NeoPixel library for Arduino installed and have run the strandtest example sketch successfully.&nbsp;</strong>If not, return to the prior page for directions to set that up.</p>
<p>To learn about writing your own NeoPixel sketches, let’s begin by <strong>dissecting the strandtest sketch</strong>…</p>
