      The overall brightness of all the LEDs can be adjusted using <span class="editor-monospace">setBrightness()</span>. This takes a single argument, a number in the range <span class="editor-monospace">0</span> (off) to <span class="editor-monospace">255</span> (max brightness). For example, to set a strip to 1/4 brightness:
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
    
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  
  

