      <div class="text-element">
  
  
  
  
  
        <p>It's easy to use NeoPixel LEDs with Python or CircuitPython and the <a href="../github.com/adafruit/Adafruit_CircuitPython_NeoPixel">Adafruit CircuitPython NeoPixel</a> module.&nbsp; This module allows you to easily write Python code that controls your LEDs.</p>
<p>You can use these LEDs with any CircuitPython microcontroller board or with a computer that has GPIO and Python <a href="./circuitpython-on-raspberrypi-linux">thanks to Adafruit_Blinka, our CircuitPython-for-Python compatibility library</a>.</p>
      




